    "enUS": {
      "description": "Home. Return home, young {race}.\n\nYour spiritual leader Ur'kyo begs you to return to him and speak about the path you travel.\n\nGo to the Valley of Spirits in the great Horde city of Orgrimmar. You will find him there.",
      "summary": "Speak to Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar.",
      "title": "Hex of Weakness",
